# How This Teacher Feels About All This AI Stuff

![rw-book-cover](https://readwise-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/static/images/article3.5c705a01b476.png)

## Metadata
- Author: [[Marcus Luther from The Important Work]]
- Full Title: How This Teacher Feels About All This AI Stuff
- Category: #articles
- Summary:: Marcus Luther, a high school English teacher, shares his mixed feelings about the impact of AI on education. He feels curious yet overwhelmed and frustrated by the rapid changes and inconsistent expectations surrounding AI use in the classroom. Ultimately, he believes that the future of education requires imagination and a focus on what classrooms can become, rather than just efficiency.

